        </div>
        <p class="demo-caption">Campaign results can be read by person or by team. Repeat clickers shows who fell for more than one simulation, and the group leaderboard ranks teams by click rate, flagging the most vulnerable and the safest.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3 -->
