        </div>
        <p class="demo-caption">Every campaign setting lives on one form, with the email previewed live beside it. Switching templates updates the sender, subject, and body together, and the preview shows dynamic tags or the values an employee will see.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stands in for notice-vs-training.webp: the page employees see after clicking, with and without training. -->
